{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And he shall shave.</b> Since we find a final shaving by the priest, one might think this too is the same. Therefore it says <b>and he shall shave</b> — unlike any other person." "<b>And he shall shave.</b> Since we find a final shaving with a razor, one might think this too is the same. Therefore it says <b>and he shall shave</b> — by any means. <b>And he shall shave</b> — even though he is a nazirite." "<b>But the netek he shall not shave.</b> Rashi explains: he leaves two hairs etc. But if he shaves up to the netek, the lesion will not be visible, for the appearance of the plague is seen only in the hairs."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:11:56.596789346Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}